<view class="page assessment-entry"><view class="eyebrow">PHOTO ASSISTED OBSERVATION</view><view class="title">AI 辅助评估</view><view class="subtitle">准备正面、本人左侧及右侧45°照片，分析后由医生复核。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="inline-error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{needsLogin}}" class="card"><view>请先登录，任务和照片归属于您的患者账号。</view><t-button theme="primary" block bind:tap="login">前往登录</t-button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!qualityAvailable || !modelAvailable}}" class="demo-banner">辅助观察服务尚未就绪。您可以保存准备资料，也可以直接预约面诊。</view><view wx:if="{{!view}}" class="card"><picker range="{{clinics}}" range-key="name" value="{{clinicIndex}}" disabled="{{recovering || busy}}" bindchange="clinicChanged"><view class="subtitle">评估院区：{{clinics[clinicIndex].name || '暂无可预约院区'}} ▾</view></picker><t-button theme="primary" block loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!clinics.length}}" bind:tap="create">{{recovering ? '恢复原创建申请' : '创建评估任务'}}</t-button></view><block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="meta">任务编号：{{view.task.id}}</view><view class="subtitle">任务版本 {{view.task.version}}</view><view class="section-title">独立AI用途授权</view><view class="subtitle">{{view.consent.granted ? '已同意AI用途' : '尚未同意或已撤回'}}</view><t-button theme="default" block disabled="{{busy || actionPending || uploadPending || (!view.consent.granted && view.task.status !== 'draft')}}" bind:tap="consent">{{view.consent.granted ? '查看并撤回授权' : '阅读并同意AI用途'}}</t-button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">三角度照片</view><view class="subtitle">自然光、无遮挡、关闭美颜；本人左右方向请核对。短边至少512像素。</view><view wx:for="{{angles}}" wx:key="value" class="card"><view>{{item.label}} · {{item.quality}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.advice}}" wx:for-item="advice" wx:key="*this" class="subtitle">{{advice}}</view><t-button theme="primary" disabled="{{busy || actionPending || uploadPending || !view.consent.granted || view.task.status !== 'draft'}}" data-angle="{{item.value}}" bind:tap="choose">{{item.photoId ? '替换照片' : '选择照片'}}</t-button><t-button wx:if="{{item.photoId}}" theme="default" data-id="{{item.photoId}}" bind:tap="preview">预览</t-button></view><t-button wx:if="{{view.task.status === 'draft'}}" theme="default" block disabled="{{busy || !qualityAvailable || actionPending || uploadPending}}" bind:tap="check">重新检查照片</t-button><t-button wx:if="{{uploadPending}}" theme="primary" block loading="{{busy}}" bind:tap="upload">重试原照片上传</t-button><t-button wx:if="{{actionPending}}" theme="primary" block loading="{{busy}}" bind:tap="retryAction">重试原操作</t-button><t-button wx:if="{{view.task.status === 'draft'}}" theme="primary" block disabled="{{busy || !canSubmit || actionPending || uploadPending}}" bind:tap="submit">提交辅助评估</t-button><t-button theme="default" block bind:tap="task">查看任务进度</t-button></view></block></block><navigator url="/pages/schedule/index" class="footer-note">直接预约面诊 ›</navigator><view class="footer-note">照片辅助观察，具体以面诊为准。</view></view>